eaves open, worth deciding before Step 2:**\n- **Draw order of the person:** the person is drawn today under everything, including Joe. The brief doesn't say where the new person scene goes among the game node's children; if it's added after the player, the person would cover Joe.\n- **Placing the person:** the brief says `session.gd` writes only the person scene's `visible`, but something has to put it at (1335, 240) once.\n- **The shoulder pivot point** isn't given in the brief.\n- **`track_problems()`** doesn't exist anywhere in the repo and isn't a Godot method I know of. It looks like a test helper you still need to write.\n- **Existing test:** `test_hose_glow.gd` reads `player.sprite` and `player.art`. The new `joe_art.tscn` nodes have to keep those two names, and they must exist before `HoseGlow` is added in `_ready()`.\n\nI couldn't run `godot` or `git`; both needed approval. So the engine version comes from the committed logs, and none of the A7 files (sheet, scenes, library, bake tool, preview) exist yet."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":163,"cache_read_input_tokens":151960,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":163},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"34beee16-17c2-491e-9181-76b6f2539149","uuid":"a702236c-2be3-44e5-8340-cb12ca5c8599","timestamp":"2026-11-22T20:09:38.714Z","request_id":"req_011ChJaAywWT4TevvXnRzzXJ"}
